    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know... i know people say those things. but they don't understand the stillness i'm looking for. they don't understand that sometimes the only way to find peace is to just... stop. it feels like a door is right in front of me, julian. a quiet, dark door that would finally let me rest. don't you think it would be beautiful? for everything to just finally be still?",
